# This repo is PUBLIC and every tracked byte is world-readable forever, so nothing lands
# here by accident. There is no .gitignore-shaped near-miss on record yet; this exists so
# there never is one, because `git add -A` in a directory someone used as scratch is how
# a private file becomes a permanent public one.

# scratch / extraction dirs
.txt/
.scratch/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig

# editor + OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# anything that has ever held a secret
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
token.json
client_secret*.json
